  "prefLabel": "Puc 802.09 Holiday",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 802.09 “Holiday” means any legal holiday pursuant to RSA 288:1 or, when such holiday falls on a Sunday, the following day pursuant to RSA 288:2.\n\nSource. #7350, eff 8-23-00; ss by #9226, INTERIM, eff 8-16-08; ss by #9318, eff 11-8-08; ss by #12102, eff 2-8-17",
